### 用户管理模块测试文件 (更新版)
### 项目：lqq-ai-agent
### 端口：8080
### 更新时间：2025-11-20
### ===========================================

### 1. 用户注册 - 正常注册
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "userName": "testuser",
  "password": "password123",
  "checkPassword": "password123"
}

### 2. 用户登录 - 正常登录
POST http://localhost:8123/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "3477981312@qq.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 3. 获取当前登录用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/user/get/login
Accept: application/json

### 4. 根据ID获取用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/user/get/vo?id=1
Accept: application/json

### 5. 用户注销
POST http://localhost:8080/user/logout
Content-Type: application/json

